# Files kept in version control but deliberately excluded from the App Store
# upload package that `git archive` builds.
#
# .gitlab-ci.yml: neither application known to clear the gate ships one inside
# its package. The file that governs the pipeline lives in the deployment
# GitLab repository and a version upload does not update it, so a copy in the
# package is inert at best and misleading to the next person at worst. The copy
# stays in this repository for reference and history.
#
# .claude/ and .ruff.toml: tooling for this repository, not part of the
# deployable artifact.
.gitlab-ci.yml export-ignore
.claude/ export-ignore
.ruff.toml export-ignore

# reference/: the CelesTrak SATCAT snapshot, 9 MB. Held here as the reference
# of record because celestrak.org and space-track.org both return 403 at the
# organisation proxy. Kept out of the upload package: the container needs the
# few dozen rows the catalogue references, which scripts/extract_satcat.py
# distils into src/satcat_extract.json, and a static catalogue inside a
# deployed image goes stale with nobody watching.
reference/ export-ignore
